    },
    {
      "id": "rules_24h_frequency",
      "kind": "attr",
      "tier": "detail",
      "select": {
        "types": [
          "aws_config_config_rule"
        ]
      },
      "cond": {
        "path": "maximum_execution_frequency",
        "op": "eq",
        "value": "TwentyFour_Hours"
      },
      "quote": "evaluated every twenty-four hours or upon configuration changes"
    },
    {
      "id": "required_tags_keys",
      "kind": "all_of",
      "tier": "detail",
      "quote": "checking for \"terraform.io\" and \"environment\" tags",
      "checks": [
        {
          "kind": "attr",
          "select": "tags_rule",
          "cond": {
            "path": "input_parameters",
            "op": "contains",
            "value": "\"terraform.io\""
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "attr",
          "select": "tags_rule",
          "cond": {
            "path": "input_parameters",
            "op": "contains",
            "value": "\"environment\""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "required_tags_scope_s3",
      "kind": "attr",
      "tier": "detail",
      "select": "tags_rule",
      "cond": {
        "path": "scope.*.compliance_resource_types.*",
        "op": "regex",
        "value": "S3::Bucket$"
      },
      "quote": "specifically scoped to \"S3::Bucket\" resources"
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Change-triggered evaluation is not expressible separately (rules without maximum_execution_frequency); only the 24-hour periodic frequency is checked (some rule). The role/topic name comes from a random petname under defaults (unknown at plan), so only the random_pet fallback is checked. Review 2026-09-24: petname fallback accepted as declared-only; bucket-write accepts s3:Put*/s3:* in any policy shape incl. declared (policies are unknown at plan); delivery->bucket also by literal name. | 2026-10-03 review: SNS publish permission also read from declared policy text."
}
